# Yoshimaru alone cannot supply the mandatory other friendly creature (CR 603.3d).
# Its trigger asks no targets even with an opposing creature available; the fight scenario is the positive control.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Yoshimaru, Scrappy Stray
Forest x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Yoshimaru, Scrappy Stray.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
! Bot1.Target
Bot1.Pass

